         <h4>Purpose:</h4>
         <div class="indent">
            <p>This web app is a full stack implementation of a shopping list database. It was built for my mother, Lori, as a way to keep track of all of her different shopping lists.</p>
            <p>Some of the most important features were the ability to have multiple lists, all with their own customizable name and color, and the ability to cross things off of your list without deleting them.</p>
            <p>During this project, I learned alot about full stack development, using node.js, mysql and apache. I got to learn alot about SSL and TLS and how they play into web security, as the site is secured via https.
               I hope to continue adding features, some of which are listed below.</p>
         </div>
